<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables -.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables -.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Thursday that Buenos Aires Embotelladora, Huntingdon Life Sciences Group and Luria &amp; Son were unavailable in after-hours trade.</p>
<p>The exchange also said that W.R. Grace &amp; Co, Sealed Air Corp, Pep Boys, Reader's Digest Association Inc and PepsiCo were unavailable during after-hours trade for news.</p>
